/P 76 0 R
/E (This project presents a comprehensive multi-agent intelligent system for Smart Traffic Control, developed as part of the Game Theory Applications in Intelligent Systems course. The central objective is to model the strategic interactions between autonomous vehicles or traffic agents at a controlled intersection, using formal game-theoretic frameworks to derive optimal decision strategies. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
