/E (Each simulation round proceeds as follows: \(1\) both agents call choose_action\(\); \(2\) TrafficEnvironment resolves the payoff pair from the matrix and adds noise; \(3\) each agent calls update_beliefs\(\) with the opponent's action; \(4\) AdaptiveAgents call update_q\(\) with their realized payoff; \(5\) both agents call record\(\) to log history; \(6\) the round log is appended for later analysis. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
