/T (The payoff evolution plot displays two subplots: \(a\) per-round noisy payoffs for both agents, and \(b\) cumulative payoffs over all rounds. In the BestResponse vs Mixed scenario, Agent A's cumulative payoff grows significantly faster than Agent B's, reflecting A's exploitation of B's predictable mixed strategy. The noise makes individual rounds volatile but the trend is clear in the cumulative chart. )
/E (The payoff evolution plot displays two subplots: \(a\) per-round noisy payoffs for both agents, and \(b\) cumulative payoffs over all rounds. In the BestResponse vs Mixed scenario, Agent A's cumulative payoff grows significantly faster than Agent B's, reflecting A's exploitation of B's predictable mixed strategy. The noise makes individual rounds volatile but the trend is clear in the cumulative chart. )
