/P 87 0 R
/E (The project demonstrates that game theory provides a principled and computationally tractable foundation for multi-agent traffic management. The combination of equilibrium analysis for static understanding and adaptive learning for dynamic behavior covers both the theoretical and practical dimensions of intelligent system design. )
/Pg 22 0 R
